.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH ifg-repo 1  "ifg-repo 0.8.0" 
.SH NAME
ifg\-repo \- Work with repositories
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBifg repo\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Work with repositories
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
ifg\-repo\-list(1)
List an owner\*(Aqs repositories (default: the logged\-in user)
.TP
ifg\-repo\-view(1)
Show one repository
.TP
ifg\-repo\-create(1)
Create a repository under your account (or an organization)
.TP
ifg\-repo\-clone(1)
Clone a repository (HTTPS by default)
.TP
ifg\-repo\-delete(1)
Delete a repository (asks for confirmation unless \-\-yes)
.TP
ifg\-repo\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH VERSION
v0.8.0
